{"thread":{"threadID":1239,"boardID":98,"topic":"Bind Tutorial","time":1379090169,"userID":1206,"username":"Sadvun","lastPostTime":1379255604,"lastPoster":"SkyK1ll","replies":1,"views":611,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":10632,"threadID":1239,"userID":1206,"username":"Sadvun","subject":"Bind Tutorial","time":1379090169,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Mit binden könnt ihr viel Zeit sparen. Du kanns keys binden um Waffen und eq zu kaufen oder um irgendwas schnell zu sagen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Hier sind alle buy binds:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Pistols:<br><a href=\"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-0j-9kvSdt1U/TWLZhBm1E3I/AAAAAAAAABY/dw9ekzWeeso/s1600/pistols.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a><br>Shotguns:<br><a href=\"http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-Jr8DeOMnM1E/TWLZw7NhypI/AAAAAAAAABc/RtD5RukQBo0/s1600/shotguns.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>SMG&#x27;s:</p></div><p><br><a href=\"http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-OMZg_0zrd3k/TWLaHT2WUmI/AAAAAAAAABg/uVrS54rR9CU/s1600/SMG%2527s.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>Rifles:</p></div><p><br><a href=\"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-n1oO7wpgR8g/TWLaW3RR1OI/AAAAAAAAABk/14mV7K5dbCg/s1600/rifles.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>Machine Guns:</p></div><p><br><a href=\"http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-trYimTQNCE4/TWLanHckESI/AAAAAAAAABo/jVwBxROjVp8/s1600/LMG.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>Equipment:</p></div><p><br><a href=\"http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-GURRXPqUz14/TWLatTu8aGI/AAAAAAAAABs/prDQ9JORKDg/s1600/equipment.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Das sind alle Waffen und Eq das man binden kann. Um das zu machen gebt einfach das in die Konsole ein:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>bind &lt;key&gt; &quot;buy &lt;waffe&gt;&quot;</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>falls ihr z.B. eine AWP kaufen wollt gebt ein:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>bind b &quot;buy awp&quot;</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ihr könnt auch mehrere Sachen auf einmal kaufen:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><br></p></div><p>bind &lt;key&gt; &quot;buy &lt;waffe&gt;; buy &lt;waffe&gt;; buy &lt;waffe&gt;</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Binding im Numpad:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>Enter = KP_ENTER</p></div><div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>0 = KP_INS</p></div><div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>1 = KP_END</p></div><div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>2 = KP_DOWNARROW</p></div><div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>3 = KP_PGDN</p></div><div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>4 = KP_LEFTARROW</p></div><div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>5 = KP_5</p></div><div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>6 = KP_RIGHTARROW</p></div><div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>7 = KP_HOME</p></div><div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>8 = KP_UPARROW</p></div><div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>9 = KP_PGUP</p></div><div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>. = KP_DEL</p></div><div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>+ = KP_PLUS</p></div><div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>- = KP_MINUS</p></div><div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>* = *</p></div><p><br></p></div><p>Also falls ihr z.B. eine flash mit &quot;-&quot; kaufen wollt müsst ihr das in die konsole eingeben:<br><br>buy kp_minus &quot;buy flash&quot;<br><br>Und falls ihr jetzt z.B. einen text binden wollt gebt einfach das ein:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>bind &lt;key&gt; &quot;say&lt;dein text&gt;&quot;</p></div><p><br>Und falls ihr irgendwelche fehler gemacht habt gebt einfach unbind &lt;key&gt; oder unbind all ein.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>So das wars schon <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Hoffe es hat euch gefallen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p></div>","polls":[]},{"postID":10643,"threadID":1239,"userID":2,"username":"SkyK1ll","subject":"","time":1379255604,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>gutes <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]}]}